#: ../../templates.rst:6
msgid "A template controls presentation. It does not duplicate the source prose. Guidedog uses Jinja for HTML and Typst for PDF. For a complete worked project, follow :doc:`tutorial/a-custom-theme`. This chapter is the reference for its settings, blocks and parameters."
msgstr ""

