#: ../../templates.rst:186
msgid "Guidedog searches each directory listed in ``conf.toml`` under ``templates_path`` in order, followed by its built-in templates. Template names are relative to the directories in ``templates_path`` and cannot escape outside of them using parent directory traversal (``..``)."
